SUMMARY:Clemens Center Blood Drive
DESCRIPTION:Clemens Center Blood Drive\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				in Mandeville Hall\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				TuesdayAuguest 18\, 202612:00pm – 5:00pm \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Please call 1-800-RED CROSS or visit RedCrossBlood.org and enter: Elmira NY to make your life saving appointment today!\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n\n\n\n\n Share: \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Clemens Center presents\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				We are excited to partner with the American Red Cross on Wednesday\, July 1 for a blood drive. We’ll be working together to give back to the community in a truly life changing way since each donation we collect can save up to three lives. \nThe Red Cross has over 135 years of experience providing humanitarian aid including more than 75 years of supplying blood to those in need. We can all be part of something important when we work with the Red Cross to strengthen the blood supply and give back to our community. \nLet’s make an impact on August 18 and add saving lives to our list of great accomplishments. \nPlease call 1-800-RED CROSS or visit RedCrossBlood.org and enter: Elmira NY to make your life saving appointment today! \nIt only takes one hour to save up to 3 lives! \nNew Donors Needed!\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Ticket prices vary for each performance and are either Reserved or General Admission seating. For patrons with special needs\, please inquire about services when placing your order. \nThe Clemens Center Box Office and ClemensCenter.org are the only OFFICIAL and AUTHORIZED sellers of Clemens Center event tickets. Tickets purchased from other sources may be 1) more expensive 2) invalid and 3) ineligible for assistance. The Clemens Center is not responsible for tickets purchased from other sources.
URL:https://clemenscenter.org/event/clemens-center-blood-drive-4/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://clemenscenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Blood-Drive-Featured-Event.jpg
END:VEVENT
