SUMMARY:Mystic Pizza
DESCRIPTION:MYSTIC PIZZA\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				SaturdaySeptember 26\, 20267:30pm \nSundaySeptember 27\, 20262:00pm \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Age Recommendation: Ages 13+ \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Running Time: 2 hr 20 mins\, including a 20-min intermission \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n\n\n Share: \n \n\n\n\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Pricing\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Processing and facility maintenance fees apply.\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Broadway Series Subscription:$349 – $553 \n			\n				BUY NOW\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn More about our Series Subscription > \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn more about ouronline ticket process > \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				“An undeniably charming new musical serving up 1980s nostalgia!” Stage Raw \nMystic Pizza: A New Musical delivers the beloved story from the iconic hit film driven by a score packed with unforgettable hits from the ’80s and ’90s. Follow best friends Kat\, Daisy\, and Jojo as they navigate the complexities of friendship and romance—all while slinging slices at a small-town pizza joint. \nBursting with laugh-out-loud moments\, heartfelt storytelling\, and chart-toppers including “Hit Me With Your Best Shot\,” “Hold On\,” and “Manic Monday\,” Mystic Pizza is a joyful celebration of chasing dreams\, lifelong bonds\, and finding your place in the world. \nCritics are hungry for more: Stage Scene LA calls Mystic Pizza a “surefire hit\,” featuring “one show-stopping dance sequence after another\,” while NJ Stage praises the show as “funny\, heartwarming\, and nostalgic. \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				We are very thankful for our organization supporters:\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Dates/times/prices/programs are subject to change. \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn more about ouronline ticket process > \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Ticket prices vary for each performance and are either Reserved or General Admission seating. For patrons with special needs\, please inquire about services when placing your order. \nThe Clemens Center Box Office and ClemensCenter.org are the only OFFICIAL and AUTHORIZED sellers of Clemens Center event tickets. Tickets purchased from other sources may be 1) more expensive 2) invalid and 3) ineligible for assistance. The Clemens Center is not responsible for tickets purchased from other sources.
