DESCRIPTION:THE BODYGUARD\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Tuesday – WednesdayOctober 20 – 21\, 20267:30pm \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Age Recommendation: Ages 10+ \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Advisory: This production has repetitive flashing lights and visual effects\, pyrotechnics\, smoke and haze\, gunshots\, loud sound effects and scenes of mild peril. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Running Time: 2 hrs and 10 mins including a 20-min intermission \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n\n\n\n Share: \n \n\n\n\n\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Pricing\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Processing and facility maintenance fees apply.\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Broadway Series Subscription:\n$349 – $553\n			\n				BUY NOW\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn More about our Series Subscription >\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn more about ouronline ticket process > \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				THE INTERNATIONAL\, AWARD-WINNING SMASH-HIT MUSICAL THE BODYGUARD IS BACK! \nBased on the 1992 film starring Whitney Houston and Kevin Costner\, THE BODYGUARD is a thrilling\, romantic musical that combines high-stakes suspense with unforgettable music. Former Secret Service agent turned bodyguard\, Frank Farmer\, is hired to protect superstar Rachel Marron from an unknown stalker. Both expect to be in charge of their situation – what they don’t expect is to fall in love. \nA “BRILLIANT” (The Times)\, breathtakingly romantic thriller\, THE BODYGUARD features a whole host of unforgettable classics including “Queen of the Night\,” “So Emotional\,” “I Will Always Love You\,” “I Wanna Dance with Somebody\,” “Saving All My Love\,” and “One Moment in Time”\, alongside thrilling plot twists and emotional drama. THE BODYGUARD is an electrifying combination of romance\, suspense and chart-topping music that will captivate audiences from start to finish. \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				We are very thankful for our organization supporters:\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Dates/times/prices/programs are subject to change.\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn more about ouronline ticket process > \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Ticket prices vary for each performance and are either Reserved or General Admission seating. For patrons with special needs\, please inquire about services when placing your order. \nThe Clemens Center Box Office and ClemensCenter.org are the only OFFICIAL and AUTHORIZED sellers of Clemens Center event tickets. Tickets purchased from other sources may be 1) more expensive 2) invalid and 3) ineligible for assistance. The Clemens Center is not responsible for tickets purchased from other sources.
