SUMMARY:The Rocky Horror Picture Show Spooktacular Tour with the Original “Columbia” Nell Campbell
DESCRIPTION:The Rocky Horror Picture Show Spooktacular Tour with the Original “Columbia” Nell Campbell\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				ThursdayOctober 29\, 20267:30pm \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Rated R \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Running Time: 2 hrs and 15 mins plus an intermission. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n\n\n\n Share: \n \n\n\n\n\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				On Sale to Clemens Center Members Monday\, August 10 at 11:30am. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				On Sale to the General Public Thursday\, August 13 at 11:30am. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Pricing\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Processing and facility maintenance fees apply.\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Tickets:$155 (V.I.P.)/$55/$45/$35 \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				After Party Add-On:$40 \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Must have a ticket to the show in order to purchase an After Party ticket. Limited availability. \n			\n				BUY TICKETS\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				ORIGINAL CAST SPOOKTACULAR TOUR! \nJoin the original ‘Columbia’ – NELL CAMPBELL – for a screening of the movie in a new 4k restoration with a live shadow cast and audience participation! Plus a costume contest\, an after party immersive experience\, and more! *Get exclusive tickets to the V.I.P. Meet & Greet to meet Nell Campbell herself\, have a personal photo opportunity\, & get an autograph. \nV.I.P. MEET & GREET INCLUDES \n– VIP Meet & Greet Seating Section – The best seats in the house!– Special Rocky Horror VIP Laminate– Get a photo taken with Nell Campbell with your own camera– Bring your own personal item to autograph\, or pick out a photo from Nell’s collection to get signed– You will get an email with VIP location and start time a week before the show. \nTHE AFTER PARTY! Come up to our lab and see what’s on the slab! ($40 Add-On)Continue the Time Warp!  A unique\, unforgettable Rocky Horror-themed party after the show. Themed drinks\, music\, food\, and get to meet the shadow cast! Special prizes\, videos\, and more. \nMust have a ticket to the show in order to purchase an After Party ticket. Limited availability. \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Dates/times/programs/prices are subject to change. \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Ticket prices vary for each performance and are either Reserved or General Admission seating. For patrons with special needs\, please inquire about services when placing your order. \nThe Clemens Center Box Office and ClemensCenter.org are the only OFFICIAL and AUTHORIZED sellers of Clemens Center event tickets. Tickets purchased from other sources may be 1) more expensive 2) invalid and 3) ineligible for assistance. The Clemens Center is not responsible for tickets purchased from other sources.
