SUMMARY:The Magic School Bus: Lost in the Solar System
DESCRIPTION:The Magic School Bus: Lost in the Solar System\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				MondayDecember 7\, 202610:00am and 12:30pm \n  \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Runtime: 60 minutes\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Age Recommendation: Grades 1-5\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n\n\n Share: \n \n\n\n\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Pricing\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Tickets: $8 \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				For group and/or single tickets\, contact our School-Time Coordinator at\n607-735-2777 or  janices@clemenscenter.org\n			\n				Order Form\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				School-Time Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				A Clemens Center Mary Tripp Marks School-Time Series production presented by TheaterworksUSA\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Music and Lyrics by Matthew Lee Robinson Book by Marshall PailetOriginal Direction and Choreography by Connor GallagherScenic Design by Jason SherwoodCostume Design by Sarah Cubbage \nWhen the class gets lost on the way to the planetarium\, Ms. Frizzle saves the day by blasting into outer space for an epic interplanetary field trip! But when rivalries both old and new threaten to tear the students apart\, our young heroes must learn to pull together or risk getting forever lost in the solar system. \nHop on the Magic School Bus for a ride in this new musical adaptation based on the original book series published by Scholastic. \nThe Magic School Bus and associated logos are trademarks and/or registered marks of Scholastic Inc. \n  \nCurriculum Ties: Communication/Language Arts\, Music\, Science\, Social Studies \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Dates/times/programs are subject to change. \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				School-Time Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Ticket prices vary for each performance and are either Reserved or General Admission seating. For patrons with special needs\, please inquire about services when placing your order. \nThe Clemens Center Box Office and ClemensCenter.org are the only OFFICIAL and AUTHORIZED sellers of Clemens Center event tickets. Tickets purchased from other sources may be 1) more expensive 2) invalid and 3) ineligible for assistance. The Clemens Center is not responsible for tickets purchased from other sources.
