SUMMARY:Jersey Boys
DESCRIPTION:JERSEY BOYS\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Tuesday – WednesdayApril 13 – 15\, 20277:30pm \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Subscriber nights are April 13 & 14. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Age Recommendation: Ages 12+ \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Advisory: Flashing strobe lights\, loud gunfire\, theatrical haze\, herbal cigarette smoke and authentic\, profane Jersey vocabulary are special effects used in this production. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Running Time: 2 hrs and 30 mins\, including intermission. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n\n\n\n\n Share: \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Pricing\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Processing and facility maintenance fees apply.\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Broadway Series Subscription:\n$349 – $553\n			\n				BUY NOW\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn More about our Series Subscription >\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn more about ouronline ticket process > \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				The original Broadway sensation returns to the road! Celebrating 20 years – Jersey style!  \nThey were just four guys from Jersey\, until they sang their very first note. They had a sound nobody had ever heard… and the radio just couldn’t get enough of. But while their harmonies were perfect on stage\, off stage it was a very different story — a story that has made them an international sensation all over again. The show features all their hits including “Sherry\,” “Big Girls Don’t Cry\,” “Oh What a Night\,” “Walk Like a Man\,” “Can’t Take My Eyes Off You\,” “Beggin’” and “Working My Way Back to You.”   \nGo behind the music and inside the story of Frankie Valli and The Four Seasons in the Tony Award®-winning\, original Broadway sensation\, JERSEY BOYS.  From the streets of New Jersey to the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame\, this is the musical that’s too good to be true.  \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				We are very thankful for our organization supporters:\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Dates/times/prices/programs are subject to change.\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Questions?\nContact our Box Office:\nMonday-Friday\n11:30 am – 5:30 pm\n607-734-8191 or\n800-724-0159\nboxoffice@clemenscenter.org\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Visitor Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Learn more about ouronline ticket process > \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Ticket prices vary for each performance and are either Reserved or General Admission seating. For patrons with special needs\, please inquire about services when placing your order. \nThe Clemens Center Box Office and ClemensCenter.org are the only OFFICIAL and AUTHORIZED sellers of Clemens Center event tickets. Tickets purchased from other sources may be 1) more expensive 2) invalid and 3) ineligible for assistance. The Clemens Center is not responsible for tickets purchased from other sources.
