SUMMARY:Doktor Kaboom: Under Pressure!
DESCRIPTION:Doktor Kaboom: Under Pressure!\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				MondayApril 19\, 202710:00am and 12:30pm \n  \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Runtime: 60 minutes\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Age Recommendation: Grades 3 – 6 \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n\n\n\n\n Share: \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Pricing\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Tickets: $8 \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				For group and/or single tickets\, contact our School-Time Coordinator at\n607-735-2777 or  janices@clemenscenter.org\n			\n				Order Form\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				School-Time Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				A Clemens Center Mary Tripp Marks School-Time Series production presented by Shaw Entertainment\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Be amazed by the power of pressure – and what it can teach us. \nEqual parts interactive science\, comedy\, and personal empowerment messages\, Doktor Kaboom returns with a new show. Doktor Kaboom: Under Pressure! illustrates physical science concepts\, which are also metaphors for real-life mental and emotional pressures. \nPraised for keeping crowds riveted with interest and rolling with laughter\, Doktor Kaboom is also known for empowering volunteers from the audience to be the heroes of the moment. In Under Pressure!\, Kaboom validates the pressures some students may feel\, and shares tools and life lessons as resources for dealing with the difficulties that face us all. \n  \nCurriculum Ties: Science\, Engineering\, Forces of Nature\, Chemical Reactions\, Social/Emotional Learning \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Dates/times/programs are subject to change.\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				School-Time Information>\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				View Seating Chart (PDF)\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Ticket prices vary for each performance and are either Reserved or General Admission seating. For patrons with special needs\, please inquire about services when placing your order. \nThe Clemens Center Box Office and ClemensCenter.org are the only OFFICIAL and AUTHORIZED sellers of Clemens Center event tickets. Tickets purchased from other sources may be 1) more expensive 2) invalid and 3) ineligible for assistance. The Clemens Center is not responsible for tickets purchased from other sources.
